  "Software Details": "Detalles del programa",
  "The Marketing Module in eCommerceGo SaaS is designed to revolutionize the way you promote your business. With its robust features, you can easily activate, generate, and modify business cards to suit your brand's needs. Whether you're a new business owner or looking to refresh your brand's image, this module provides you with the flexibility to design business cards that truly represent your company's identity.": "El módulo de marketing de eCommerceGo SaaS está diseñado para revolucionar la forma de promocionar su negocio. ",
  "View Live Demo": "Ver demostración en vivo",
  "Enhance Your Business Reach with the Marketing Module": "Mejore el alcance de su negocio con el módulo de marketing",
  "Boost your sales with our powerful marketing module, designed to streamline campaigns, track performance, and drive growth effortlessly": "Aumente sus ventas con nuestro potente módulo de marketing, diseñado para optimizar las campañas, realizar un seguimiento del rendimiento e impulsar el crecimiento sin esfuerzo.",
  "Create and Edit Your Business Profile with Ease": "Cree y edite su perfil comercial con facilidad",
  "Starting a new business or managing multiple brands? The Marketing Module offers seamless options for creating new business profiles and editing them as your needs evolve. This flexibility ensures that your business information is always up to date, keeping your brand relevant in a competitive market. The module’s user-friendly interface makes it simple to add or update contact details, logos, and promotional messages, ensuring your brand always looks professional.": "¿Iniciar un nuevo negocio o gestionar varias marcas? ",
  "Choose from a Variety of Business Themes": "Elija entre una variedad de temas comerciales",
  "The Marketing Module also offers a range of customizable business themes to enhance your brand’s presentation. Whether you’re looking for something sleek and modern or classic and traditional, you can select from various themes that best align with your brand’s personality. Each theme is designed to maximize visual appeal and ensure consistency across all your marketing materials, helping you create a cohesive brand experience for your audience.": "El módulo de marketing también ofrece una variedad de temas comerciales personalizables para mejorar la presentación de su marca. ",
  "Drive Growth with Customizable Marketing Campaigns": "Impulse el crecimiento con campañas de marketing personalizables",
  "Take your business to the next level by launching dynamic marketing campaigns directly from the platform. The Marketing Module allows you to create and run targeted campaigns that can reach your desired audience effectively. Use the platforms intuitive tools to customize your campaign strategies, set your budget, and track performance in real-time. This ensures your marketing efforts are both impactful and measurable, allowing for continuous improvement.": "Lleve su negocio al siguiente nivel lanzando campañas de marketing dinámicas directamente desde la plataforma. ",
  "Streamline Your Marketing Efforts with All-in-One Tools": "Optimice sus esfuerzos de marketing con herramientas todo en uno",
  "With the Marketing Module, managing your business’s marketing efforts has never been easier. The module combines all necessary tools into one cohesive platform, allowing you to handle everything from business card creation to campaign management without ever leaving the platform. This integration simplifies your workflow, saves time, and reduces the complexity of managing multiple marketing tools, making it an essential solution for any business looking to grow.": "Con el Módulo de Marketing, gestionar los esfuerzos de marketing de su empresa nunca ha sido tan fácil. ",
  "Why choose dedicated modules": "¿Por qué elegir módulos dedicados?",
  "for your business?": "para tu negocio?",
  "With EcommerceGo, you can conveniently manage all your business functions from a single location": "Con EcommerceGo, puede administrar cómodamente todas las funciones de su negocio desde una única ubicación",
  "Empower Your Workforce with EcommerceGo": "Capacite a su fuerza laboral con EcommerceGo",
  "Access over Premium Add-ons for Product Enquiry, Product Review, Product Quick-view, and more, all in one place!": "Acceda a complementos premium para consultas de productos, reseñas de productos, vista rápida de productos y más, ¡todo en un solo lugar!",
